WEBVTT

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:10.810
No matter how much time passes, the heat of summer never changes.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.560
Every time summer comes around,

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.950
I remember my days as a young boy of thirteen, when I knew nothing at all...

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:27.300
Even now, it remains unchanged within me.

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:23.450
Hajime-chan!

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:26.120
Hajime-chan!

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.440
Come on, it's morning!

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:32.310
Hajime-chan!

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:39.890
You'll be late!

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:42.680
Kaya's gonna yell if you're late, Hajime-chan.

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:49.830
Morning, Arashi-san.

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:51.450
Morning, Hajime-chan.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:53.390
What were you doing? Were you up all night?

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:54.130
Yeah.

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:55.380
Science made fun!

00:02:54.550 --> 00:03:00.790
In our time, there's this annoying thing called "Free Study" that's part of our homework.

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:59.550
Experimental Science Guidebook

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:03.110
What do you think this is?

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:05.020
Just looks like a strawberry.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:10.440
It is a masterpiece created by I, Yasaka Hajime!

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:11.430
And I call it...

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:12.900
THE STRAWBERRY BOMB!

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:15.410
Strawberry bomb?

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.640
At first glance, it just looks like an ordinary strawberry...

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:20.260
HOWEVER!

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:21.390
In reality...

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:31.040
Inside is a mix of pop rocks, Cayenne, Japanese, and normal pepper, along with powdered wasabi!

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.030
Huh?

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:38.490
I'm sure I made three of these...

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:40.360
Why is there only one?

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.190
Sure you weren't just sleepy?

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:43.680
Grandpa...

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:46.740
No way!

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:51.950
The destructive power of the strawberry bomb is unfathomable.

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:55.790
I may have created something incredible.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:59.280
Playback Part II

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:02.880
Anyway, I don't think "bomb" is really a good idea.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.140
Then what should I do?

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.580
Change the name.

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:08.490
Call it "Cutie Strawberry-chan," maybe?

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:10.090
I'm turning this in at school!

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:12.340
I can't name it something like that!

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.870
But it's cute!

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:14.590
The matter's settled.

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:16.650
Cutie Strawberry-chan it is!

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:18.560
Come on...

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:31.180
Morning!

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:35.180
You two are late. We're just about to open.

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.580
Uh-oh, Kaya-san...

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.210
And, Arashi!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.450
What kind of greeting was that?

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:43.790
A lady must be more elegant.

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:48.210
Ladies don't sigh.

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:49.690
Kanako-san.

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:54.770
We have to get the store ready to open; you need to get to work earlier.

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:56.490
A-chaa...

00:04:56.490 --> 00:05:00.940
"A-chaa"? I think you're getting further and further from ladylike.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.990
Don't worry about the little things, Jun!

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:06.770
I see you're as unmanly as ever.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:06.780
Stop it! Don't touch me!

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.960
Oh. Good morning.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.160
Arashi-san, Hajime-san.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:13.360
Yo!

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:15.230
Yo, Yayoi-chan.

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:16.880
"Yo" is not a proper greeting!

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:19.780
You've been slacking these past few days.

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:22.730
And lately you've been flying off to the past on a whim;

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:25.880
you're not thinking about the circumstances we're in.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:29.700
I've got something to do, so I'm going on ahead.

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:38.550
Look, look, it's Takakura Ken!

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:41.520
Excuse me.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.440
You like him, don't you?

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:44.750
I do too, actually.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.430
I wonder if it's really him.

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:50.740
Maybe I'll go look, too.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.790
Even the master...?

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:54.470
I guess you got saved.

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:57.240
Aww, Hajime-chan, you ran away, didn't you?

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:59.230
Whatever do you mean!

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:02.070
Break Room

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:05.080
Kaya-san needs to do something about her lectures.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:09.090
She's famous for being a proper lady, even at her girl's school.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.950
She's German, but she really knows Japanese culture,

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:17.290
and is great at tea ceremonies, flower arranging, and dancing, all that stuff!

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:19.290
Wow. That's pretty impressive.

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:32.210
That's Kaya-san's voice.

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:34.120
She must've met Ken-san.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:34.960
Great!

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:37.280
You done, Hajime-chan?

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:38.450
Yup!

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:48.170
Well? Does it all look OK?

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:49.500
Perfect!

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:54.460
Welcome!

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:55.780
It's too hot...

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:59.270
Man, that feels great.

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.480
I love how this place has its air conditioner running.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.720
What will you order?

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:07.220
Water, get me some water.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.450
Order something that costs money.

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:17.880
I don't have any money right now.

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:19.640
You just came to cool off then?

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:22.010
What's wrong with that? I'm a regular!

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:24.470
When did that happen?!

00:07:24.470 --> 00:07:27.960
Shut up; it's too hot to argue.

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:35.050
Why you...

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:38.650
Please don't tease Hajime-chan.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:40.080
Sorry, sorry.

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:48.940
I know. I'll hit you with the new weapon I've developed, Cutie Strawberry-chan.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:51.080
But I only have one of them...

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:54.480
I need to save it for the coming final battle.

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:55.850
BUT!

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:59.200
What kind of ultimate weapon is it if I can't use it on the enemy right in front of me?

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:01.890
What should I do?

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:04.880
What are you doing, Hajime-chan?

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.390
Arashi-san.

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:08.850
I know!

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:13.080
Please, Arashi-san.

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:17.470
It's to avenge a man's humiliation!

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:18.980
I'm begging you!

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:20.360
When do you want to go?

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:21.300
Arashi-san!

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.930
Just this once.

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:24.150
Thanks!

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:31.820
Here we go.

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:33.800
Yeah!

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:12.010
Four in the morning.

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:14.810
The Cutie Strawberries are still safe right now.

00:09:14.810 --> 00:09:15.790
Let's hurry!

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:23.490
I'll get them before Grandpa eats them!

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.560
I'm disappearing?

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:32.580
Oh, I see... It's because you're sleeping nearby.

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.670
Dammit!

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:39.330
Multiple "me's" can't exist in the same time at the same place!

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:43.180
If you accidentally encounter yourself, you'll cease to exist!

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.680
What should I do, Arashi-san?

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:53.890
Hajime

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:58.660
Oh, he really did make three!

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:04.690
Hajime

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:11.610
Now, this'll really get you!

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:19.350
Have you decided on your order?

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:24.060
How about our famous strawberry iced coffee?

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:29.010
Perhaps strawberry cola?

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:30.200
No!

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.190
A strawberry sandwich?

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:33.140
No!

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:34.600
Strawberry curry.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:35.250
No!

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:37.120
Strawberry spaghetti with meat sauce?!

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:38.990
What kind of weird crap are you trying to feed me?!

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.060
I've come all this way and I have to stop here?

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:46.340
I guess I've saved these as long as I can.

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:50.860
I'll get rid of them while there's somebody here with a strong stomach.

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:54.720
Here you are!

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:58.090
Mixed fruit juice!

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:00.170
I didn't order that.

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:04.060
It's a special for our regular customers. 300 yen.

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:06.640
I told you I don't have any money today.

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:08.160
Then, 200 yen.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:09.480
A bit lower.

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:10.970
195 yen!

00:11:10.970 --> 00:11:12.600
I don't have any change!

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:14.060
200 yen will do.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.890
Thanks!

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.740
What are you looking for, Hajime-chan?

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.870
I can't find the Cutie Strawberry-chan...

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:26.410
Th-This is...

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:34.240
Were they too far past their expiration date?

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:49.450
Welcome!

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:51.960
Yo, Arashi-san.

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:53.390
Yamashiro-san!

00:11:57.680 --> 00:11:58.830
I brought it.

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:02.540
The book you were talking about yesterday.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:03.650
All right!

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:05.440
Can I borrow it?

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:06.340
Of course!

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:08.080
Thank you!

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:09.930
That jerk!

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:15.300
I thought it was just the one time, but now he's being all friendly with Arashi-san again!

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:18.880
But I'm one step ahead of him!

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:22.840
He always orders strawberry shortcake, right?

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:25.830
I've got something to do, I'm going on ahead.

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:35.890
This morning, I swapped in a Cutie Strawberry-chan for the strawberry in the shortcake.

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:43.070
I'll give this to him.

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:46.960
There were two this morning.

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:50.700
Nobody but Shades seems to have been hit with it.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:51.970
Which means...

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:55.540
Somebody ate the cake that didn't have the Cutie Strawberry-chan in it.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:56.490
OK!

00:12:56.490 --> 00:13:00.250
Taste my ultimate weapon!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.350
Are you ready to order?

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:07.130
Yes, I'll have some English lemonade and my usual strawberry shortcake...

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:08.340
Here you are!

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:11.650
An accelerator?

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:14.770
Th-That was fast.

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:17.770
You're a regular after all.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:23.470
Now, taste the ultimate masterpiece of Yasaka Hajime!

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:40.380
Embarrass yourself in front of Arashi-san!

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:45.340
The strawberry shortcake here sure is good.

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.330
Thank you very much.

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:51.510
A dud?

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:53.400
I, of all people, made a mistake?

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.010
Hajime...

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:56.690
What do you want?

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.980
I know all about your evil deeds.

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:04.160
What happened with Shades back there was your doing too, wasn't it?

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:05.450
Wh-What are you-

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:08.020
Where do you think the other cake went?

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.700
This morning Kaya-san asked me to save one for her.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:15.700
Kaya-san did?

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:18.710
I bet she took it with her for a snack.

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:21.940
Oh no!

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:24.050
It's time for her break!

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:29.150
I hope you make it in time.

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:33.570
I haven't eaten it yet.

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:35.280
I-I see...

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:39.580
Looks like she didn't eat it.

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:41.330
I see...

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:45.300
Someone ate my strawberry shortcake?

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:49.590
I was looking forward to it, but oh well.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:53.230
Is NOT what I'm going to say.

00:14:58.190 --> 00:14:58.910
Unforgivable.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.030
WHO ATE MY STRAWBERRY SHORTCAKE?!

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:05.250
Horrible! Nigh inhuman!

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:09.820
Hajime, you didn't eat it, did you?

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:10.850
No, no I don't!

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:14.400
Then who?

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:17.210
I don't like sweets.

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:19.730
I was out shopping...

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:22.390
I was out on the floor the whole time.

00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:23.250
Jun!

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:24.740
It wasn't you, wasn't it?

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:26.970
What did I ever do to you...

00:15:26.970 --> 00:15:31.410
I... I mean I was in the back doing my homework.

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:34.280
That leaves one person!

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:36.750
Strawberry shortcake?

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:38.860
It wasn't you either?

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:39.750
Yeah.

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:43.010
And the only person to order one today is Yamashiro-san...

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:47.230
Should I not have eaten it?

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:52.930
Then, who took it?

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.890
What's with her?

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:58.550
She loves her sweets... seriously.

00:15:58.550 --> 00:15:59.990
Is that all?

00:15:59.990 --> 00:16:01.940
What do you mean is that all?

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.760
Fine, fine.

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:07.310
In our time there were barely any sweets to be had.

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:11.110
That image is still burnt firmly into her mind.

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:15.660
Then, where is the Cutie Strawberry-chan I used?

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:18.790
Well, if it's gone, it's gone. Why don't you give up?

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.280
No, I refuse.

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:23.300
I'm going to find the criminal!

00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:24.370
Criminal?

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:28.620
And I'm going to teach them such a lesson,
that they'll never be able do this again!

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:31.510
Jun.

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:34.600
Y-You can't mean...

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.470
That's right.

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:38.930
Let's go.

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:46.080
Oh no...

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:51.970
At this rate, she'll find the Cutie Strawberry-chan and I'll be the one taught a lesson!

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:52.810
Arashi-san!

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:54.540
How did I know?

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:08.000
9:45 AM.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.310
Arashi and Hajime are changing in the back.

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:13.080
And we should be outside.

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:15.430
This was when we were looking for Takakura Ken?

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:17.780
I'll watch for the criminal to come...

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:18.610
OK.

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:21.550
My hand is invisible...

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.100
Be careful.

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:26.900
Encounter yourself at this time and you'll cease to exist.

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.400
You're nuts!

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:39.070
There's only one shortcake!

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:41.250
It was you two, wasn't it?!

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:46.670
N-No, we aren't the we from this time, we're the we who followed you from the future!

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:48.430
The shortcake was gone when we got here!

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:50.580
You can't fool me!

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:51.780
Listen to me, Kaya!

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:53.450
That strawberry shortcake is...

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:54.980
No talking!

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:56.590
Temporary retreat!

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:06.390
This won't be enough to stop me!

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:09.310
W-Wait, Kaya-san...

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:12.780
We'll go back to our time and then go back further.

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:25.130
Oh... Hey, Kaya, that shortcake...

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:27.870
I'm sorry, we're in a hurry and we can talk later.

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:36.970
If we jump here, we won't encounter ourselves back then.

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:46.600
9:30 AM.

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:48.810
Fifteen minutes earlier than last time.

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:50.590
We'll get there before they do.

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:53.910
I'm almost totally disappeared!

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:56.260
Because the you from this time is very close to you.

00:18:58.370 --> 00:18:59.560
We're back.

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:00.990
You seem rather unstable.

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:03.310
You're always too calm about this!

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:06.440
We're here.

00:19:06.440 --> 00:19:10.200
A lady must be more elegant.

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:16.490
          Hajime

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:16.490
Kaya                                     Arashi

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:14.980
Ladies don't sigh.

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:16.490
Kanako-san.

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:21.770
We have to get the store ready to open; you need to get to work earlier.

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:23.500
A-chaa...

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:27.550
"A-chaa"? I think you're getting further and further from ladylike.

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:27.550
Jun

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:29.760
Kanako

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:29.760
Hajime

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:29.760
Kaya                    Arashi

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:29.760
Don't worry about the little things, Jun.

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:31.780
I see you're as unmanly as ever.

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:35.920
We'll have to get ourselves out of here if we want to get to the strawberry shortcake.

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:37.530
But how?

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:38.320
I know.

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:40.270
Jun, you can...

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:50.940
Look, look!

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:53.000
It's Takakura Ken!

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:00.410
Excuse me for a moment.

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:03.990
Jun, this way quickly!

00:20:03.990 --> 00:20:05.500
I'm disappearing, I'm disappearing!

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:07.320
You like him, don't you?

00:20:07.320 --> 00:20:08.420
I do too, actually.

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:09.980
I wonder if it's really him.

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:13.160
Where is he, I wonder?

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:15.310
The voice was close...

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:17.150
Maybe it was a trick?

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:19.590
He may really be here!

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:20.510
Great!

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:21.900
Brains win again!

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:28.080
Oh no... Kaya-san is here too!

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:32.250
You aren't in the shop right now?

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:35.210
You'll go this far to get in my way?

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:37.140
Th-That's not it.

00:20:37.140 --> 00:20:41.090
My only hope now is to get that strawberry shortcake first.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:43.510
Wait, Kaya-san!

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.090
You're still in front of the store...

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:48.220
Where did Takakura Ken go?

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.130
She slid through it!

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:06.290
That's not really a good use of ethereal energy...

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:09.310
We don't have time to stand here!

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:10.110
I'll go around from the back!

00:21:10.110 --> 00:21:11.540
Hajime-chan, wait!

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:14.570
Right now we're changing in the back!

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:16.160
What?

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:18.410
Hajime                                                        Arashi

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:19.870
No way...

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:21.630
It's all over?!

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:28.670
My strawberry shortcake.

00:21:28.670 --> 00:21:30.410
This time you're safe.

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:33.960
It was a long journey...

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:40.940
Time to eat!

00:21:52.510 --> 00:21:56.610
Hajime                                                        Arashi

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:54.560
That's Kaya-san's voice.

00:21:54.560 --> 00:21:56.620
She must've run into Ken-san.

00:21:56.730 --> 00:22:00.110
To Be Continued

00:23:30.950 --> 00:23:32.280
When you think of summer.

00:23:32.280 --> 00:23:34.290
You think of summer homework!

00:23:34.290 --> 00:23:35.800
Whether you do it first and play,

00:23:35.800 --> 00:23:38.970
or you put it off till the last second and do a rush job, will decide the rest of your life.

00:23:38.970 --> 00:23:40.250
What if you just don't do it at all?

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:41.560
Then you're a horrible person!

00:23:41.560 --> 00:23:43.350
Get up bright and early again tomorrow!
